14
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,790
So he coated them in Silver's weak glue.

15
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,070
They stayed, and they peeled off clean.

16
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,990
But the first time 3M sold them, in four

17
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:31,090
cities, they flopped.

18
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:33,010
They were called Press 'n Peel.

19
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:35,130
In nineteen eighty, they came back as

20
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:35,730
Post-it Notes.

21
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:38,150
He was trying to make glue that never lets

22
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:38,470
go.

23
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:40,830
It's on your fridge because it always

24
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:41,150
does.
